@"
# Forge Studio v0.38.3

Reliability and workbench UX release built on verified 0.38.2.

- Godot projects open natively by default instead of attempting Web export first.
- Native Run skips the duplicate pre-import pass; explicit Validate still performs the Godot import check.
- Keeps bundled official Godot Engine 4.7.1-stable x64 and runs a real scene before and after packaging.
- Removes the once-per-second product-surface rerender and reduces idle bootstrap polling.
- Makes the workflow explicit: Run, Open Godot/project, Validate, Capture and Export.
- Shows elapsed startup time and actionable failures instead of an unexplained spinner.
- Preserves the 0.38.1 renderer fix and 0.38.2 runtime preflight.
"@|Set-Content -Encoding utf8 'builder/release/RELEASE_NOTES.md'
